{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:QOU.SchurWeyl.HeckeInclusion","@type":"LeanModule","name":"QOU.SchurWeyl.HeckeInclusion","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:QOU.SchurWeyl.HeckeAlgebra"],"declarations":4,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.SchurWeyl.HeckeInclusion.adjoin_range_σ_eq_top","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.SchurWeyl.HeckeInclusion.adjoin_range_σ_eq_top","kind":"theorem","line":66,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/SchurWeyl/HeckeInclusion.lean#L66-L82","doc":"**The generators generate `H_n(q)` as an algebra** (general `n`):\n`Algebra.adjoin K {σ_0, …, σ_{n-1}} = ⊤`.  The general-`n` form of\n`HeckeDim3.adjoin_gens_eq_top`; the base step of the coset-decomposition\nspanning argument. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.SchurWeyl.HeckeInclusion.heckeIncl_σ","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.SchurWeyl.HeckeInclusion.heckeIncl_σ","kind":"theorem","line":61,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/SchurWeyl/HeckeInclusion.lean#L61-L64","doc":"The inclusion sends `σ_i` (in `H_n`) to `σ_i` (in `H_{n+1}`, embedded index). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.SchurWeyl.HeckeInclusion.heckeIncl","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.SchurWeyl.HeckeInclusion.heckeIncl","kind":"def","line":38,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/SchurWeyl/HeckeInclusion.lean#L38-L59","doc":"**The tower inclusion** `H_n(q) ↪ H_{n+1}(q)` (`σ_i ↦ σ_i`), as an algebra map.\nWell-defined by the universal property: the embedded generators satisfy the same\nHecke relations. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.SchurWeyl.HeckeInclusion.gen","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.SchurWeyl.HeckeInclusion.gen","kind":"def","line":35,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/SchurWeyl/HeckeInclusion.lean#L35-L36","doc":"The generator images: `σ_i ∈ H_{n+1}(q)` for `i : Fin n`, via `Fin.castSucc`. ","signatureChunk":0}]}